  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rberedande st&#xf6;d Resonance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparatory support Resonance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Insatsen syftar till att st&#xf6;dja Centre Resonance under f&#xf6;rberedelsefasen f&#xf6;r kommande k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att implementera 20 prioriterade rekommendationer utifr&#xe5;n den systembaserade revisionsrapporten som utf&#xf6;rdes av SDA 2015. Det h&#xe4;r &#xe4;r en insats av f&#xf6;rberedande natur f&#xf6;r att bist&#xe5; Resonance med att utveckla institutionell kapacitet, interna rutiner och kompetens hos personalen f&#xf6;r att kunna implementera k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;dsverksamhet. Efter uppf&#xf6;ljning av f&#xf6;rberedelserna f&#xf6;r k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d kan Sida komma att, genom k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d, forts&#xe4;tta samarbetet med Resonance utifr&#xe5;n den strategiska planen, korresponderande &#xe5;rsplaner, resultatramverk, budget och projektf&#xf6;rslag. En total budget p&#xe5; 237 464 SEK  kommer att beviljas f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja Resonance i f&#xf6;rberedelsefasen f&#xf6;r k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d under 6 m&#xe5;nader.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims to support the Centre Resonance during the pre-core support phase to implement 20 priority recommendations provided by the SDA system-based audit report produced in 2015. This is a contribution of a preparatory nature to assist Resonance to develop institutional capacities, internal routines, staff knowledge and skills to be able to implement core support activities if Sida decides so.  After the pre-core support follow-up repot, Sida may consider continuing the core support with Resonance based on the Strategic Plan, corresponding annual plans, RAF, budget and the project proposal. A total budget of 237 464 SEK will be granted to support Resonance pre-core activities during 6 months.</narrative>
  </description>
